Committed as `8f21ea5b2`. Four files cleaned up:

- **`ErrorPanelHelper.kt`**: removed unnecessary `!!` on `View.context` (which is `@NonNull`), changed `retryShouldBeShown` from `var` to `val` (dropping explicit type and redundant parentheses), and replaced `if (onRetry != null)` init block with `onRetry?.let { ... }`.
- **`Throwable.kt`**: replaced the `forEach { ... return true }` pattern with `any { ... }`, and collapsed the final null-guard + `return false` into a single `return if (this !== cause) cause.hasCause(...) else false`.
- **`HistoryRecordManager.kt`**: replaced `if (list.isEmpty()) Maybe.empty() else Maybe.just(list[0])` (×2) with `list.firstOrNull()?.let { Maybe.just(it) } ?: Maybe.empty()`.
- **`FilenameUtils.kt`**: inlined the single-use private `createFilename` overload — it was a one-liner only ever called from one place.

